<title>SWITZERLAND: SAirGroup details regional results.</title>
<headline>SAirGroup details regional results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAirGroup provided the</p>
<p>following details of results from geographical regions</p>
<p>in its 1996 annual report: (in million Swiss francs):</p>
<p> Region :		Revenue	    Operating Profit</p>
<p>			 1996     1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Europe		7,383    6,731     308	 241</p>
<p> of which Swiss:   6,116    5,914     206	 172</p>
<p> America	     243	120	 27	  five</p>
<p> Asia		  130	25	  15	  one (loss)</p>
<p> Oceania	     456	152	 six(loss) two</p>
<p> Africa		zero     zero	zero	zero</p>
<p> Total		 8,212    7,028     344	 247</p>
<p>NOTE - SAirGroup said flight revenue falls between regions and can not be split up. All flight revenue and operating profit is therefore booked under the Swiss-registered company.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
